  "_notes": [
    "ATOMIC: nothing is persisted. The plant does NOT move and the basket is untouched, which stateAfter records rather than asserts in prose.",
    "\uD83D\uDEA9 core/api.ts maps a non-2xx-with-envelope to ApiError(kind:'business') carrying message + errors[0].errorCode, but it DROPS body.data. The console therefore reads the offending lines off the PREVIEW it already holds, not off this refusal — which is exactly why every 'are you sure' rides the success path instead (§5).",
    "This capture reaches the refusal on the FIRST call, with no preview before it: the atomicity check fires on the preview too, so an unpriceable line is refused before the agent is ever asked to accept a diff they could not commit."
